flowchart LR
  Record["Authored record: ID and revision"] --> Envelope["External source occurrence: repo / commit / path / digest"]
  Envelope --> Validate["Validate authority, scope, lineage"]
  Validate --> Graph["Typed relationship graph"]
  Validate --> Summary["Cited summaries and embeddings"]
  Graph --> Retrieval["Scoped current/history retrieval"]
  Summary --> Retrieval
  Retrieval --> Operator["Operator selects excerpt"]
  Operator --> Frozen["Frozen selected packet"]
  Tombstone["Supersession / deletion policy"] --> Graph
  Tombstone --> Summary
  Tombstone --> Retrieval
